## 🏗️ Architecture

This project is built using **Hexagonal Architecture (Ports & Adapters)** adhering to `skills/python-hexagonal`:

- `src/{{ package_name }}/application/model/`: Domain entities and value objects (using `@dataclass(slots=True, frozen=True)`).
- `src/{{ package_name }}/application/port/`: Inbound and outbound protocol interfaces (`typing.Protocol`).
- `src/{{ package_name }}/application/service/`: Application services orchestrating CQRS workflows.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/infrastructure/adapter/`: Adapters implementing application ports.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/presentation/cli/`: Delivery mechanisms and composition root.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/shared/exception/`: Fail-closed domain exceptions.

AI agents working in this repository should refer to [`AGENTS.md`](file:///home/romuald/Projects/Perso/Skills/AGENTS.md) for architectural rules and engineering constraints.
